  "ruleText": "Plc 2002.05 “Certified community health worker (certified CHW)” means “certified community health worker” as defined in RSA 326-N:1, IV, reprinted in Appendix B. The term includes “certificant”.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
